,"index":1,"text":{"ja":"「対魔忍、井河アサギよ。対魔忍の隊長の実力、教えてあげるわ」","en":"Taimanin, it's Igawa Asagi. I'll teach you what a Taimanin commander can do."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00016_1/uni00016_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"状況はどうなっている？　先を読み先手を打っていくのが大切よ","en":"What's the situation? It's important to read ahead and take the initiative."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00016_1/uni00016_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"ふふふ、ご苦労様。あまり根を詰めないようにしなさい","en":"Hehe, good work. Don't push yourself too hard."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00016_1/uni00016_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"……何をしているのかしら？　今それが必要があるとは思わないわ","en":"…What are you doing? I don't think that's necessary right now."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00016_1/uni00016_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"ちょっと、ここ間違っているわよ。しっかりしなさい","en":"Hey, this is wrong. Pull yourself together."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00016_1/uni00016_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"はあ……ああ、大丈夫よ。対魔忍は個性の強い子が多いから、まとめるのはちょっと大変だけど","en":"Haa…yeah, it's fine. Taimanin have a lot of strong personalities, so keeping them together can be a bit tough."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00016_1/uni00016_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"魔の物を討つ、それが対魔忍、それが私対魔忍アサギよ！","en":"Hunting down demonic things, that's what Taimanin do, that's me, Taimanin Asagi!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00016_1/uni00016_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"対魔忍アサギ推参！　悪しき魑魅魍魎共覚悟しろ！","en":"Taimanin Asagi reporting! Evil youkai, prepare yourselves!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00016_1/uni00016_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00016_1/uni00016_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"te